```
PROGRAM: Glucose Repression
ORGANISM: Saccharomyces cerevisiae
FUNCTION: Regulate carbon source utilization based on glucose availability

MAIN ALGORITHM:
─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
FUNCTION glucose_repression(glucose_concentration):
    
    // PRIMARY DECISION POINT - IF-THEN-ELSE
    IF (glucose_concentration > 0.2% w/v):
        ───── HIGH GLUCOSE BRANCH ─────
        // Repress alternative carbon source genes
        CALL repress_gal_genes()
        CALL repress_suc2()
        CALL repress_maltose_genes()
        
        // Activate glucose metabolism
        glycolysis.flux = MAXIMUM
        fermentation.state = ACTIVE
        
        // Maintain state with feedback
        WHILE (glucose > threshold):
            MAINTAIN repression
            MONITOR glucose_level
        
        RETURN glucose_metabolism_active
        
    ELSE:
        ───── LOW GLUCOSE BRANCH ─────
        // Activate alternative carbon genes
        CALL activate_gal_genes()
        CALL activate_suc2()
        
        // Switch to respiration
        respiration.state = ACTIVE
        
        RETURN alternative_metabolism_active

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

FUNCTION repress_gal_genes():
    // STEP 1: Glucose sensing (AND gate)
    IF (glucose_high AND sensor_activated):
        
        // STEP 2: Inactivate Snf1 kinase (NOT gate)
        snf1.state = INACTIVE  // via Reg1 phosphatase
        
        // STEP 3: Mig1 remains dephosphorylated
        mig1.phosphorylation = LOW
        
        // STEP 4: Conditional nuclear import
        IF (mig1.phosphorylation == LOW):
            mig1.localization = NUCLEUS  // via Srp1 importin
            
            // STEP 5: DNA binding and corepressor recruitment
            FOR EACH target_promoter IN gal_promoters:
                mig1.bind_dna(target_promoter)
                mig1.recruit(ssn6_tup1_corepressor)
                
                // STEP 6: Chromatin modification
                ssn6_tup1.recruit_hdac()
                chromatin.deacetylate()
                chromatin.state = REPRESSIVE
                
                // STEP 7: Block transcription
                transcription.state = BLOCKED
            
            // OUTPUT: Genes OFF
            GAL1.expression = OFF  // >1000x repression
            GAL2.expression = OFF
            SUC2.expression = OFF
    
    RETURN repression_complete

───────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

LOGIC GATES IDENTIFIED:
• AND:  (glucose_high) AND (sensor_active) → snf1_inactivation
• NOT:  NOT(snf1_active) → mig1_nuclear
• NOT:  NOT(repression) → gene_expression
• WHILE: Maintain state while glucose present
• IF-THEN-ELSE: Primary pathway selection

COMPUTATIONAL COMPLEXITY:
• Decision points: 5
• State machines: 2 (Snf1, Mig1 localization)
• Feedback loops: 2
• Cyclomatic complexity: 8
```

